; Caulder, D2 "Claw, tritone": the sketch D hook over a bass that sinks chromatically (B, A#, A, G#) and stabs on the flat second and the tritone. B minor, 124 bpm. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
song caulder_d2
tempo 124
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst horn = A.111 shift=-12
inst pick = A.36 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
inst timp = A.47 shift=24
hit kick=36 rim=37 clap=39 snare=40 hat=44 ohat=46 tom1=45 tom2=48 tom3=50 crash=49

